        "readable_text": "Content:\nIn the math section of the SAT exam, you may be asked to identify conditions where a linear equation has zero, one, or infinitely many solutions. This concept often appears in questions such as: \u201cIf this equation has no solution, what must be true about the constants?\u201d"
