        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nHow many solutions does the equation [MATH: 8(6x + 2) = 4(12x + 4)] have?\n\nChoices:\na. Infinitely many\nb. Exactly one\nc. Impossible to determine\nd. Zero\ne. Exactly two"
